  - m_Id: 5340893094600773
    m_Localized: Gnidalf the Unwashed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600774
    m_Localized: Halt, who goes there! Oh, the prince... Halt anyway!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600775
    m_Localized: Step aside, guard. I'm here for the princess. State business!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600776
    m_Localized: Gnidalf dragged her to the swamps! But don't go there... it STINKS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600777
    m_Localized: Should have warmed up before the heroics, your highness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600778
    m_Localized: Achoo! Who dares enter my fragrant lair?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600779
    m_Localized: The princess is saved! Though now a long bath is in order...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600780
    m_Localized: Ha-ha! While you're busy here, I've slipped you a couple of my...
      fragrances!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600781
    m_Localized: Card acquired!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600782
    m_Localized: Choose your language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600783
    m_Localized: 'Play a creature: drag a creature card from your hand onto your
      front line. Not enough gold? Press End Turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600784
    m_Localized: 'Great! Now move: click your creature, then an adjacent cell. Out
      of actions? End Turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600785
    m_Localized: 'Reach the enemy creature and attack: click your creature, then
      the enemy on an adjacent cell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600786
    m_Localized: Mana acquired! Play a spell from your hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600787
    m_Localized: Final blow! Reach the enemy back line and attack their avatar until
      victory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5340893094600788
    m_Localized: "That's it, you're trained. It only gets worse from here \u2014
      but more fun."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5344678172942336
    m_Localized: Forest MILF
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5344678172942337
    m_Localized: 'When played: restores *3* health and gives *3* mana'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624514355200
    m_Localized: Hungry Cook
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881152
    m_Localized: 'When played: destroys an enemy creature on the battlefield, in
      hand, and in the deck'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881153
    m_Localized: Glutton
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881154
    m_Localized: Gains +*2*/+*2* for each charm you control
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881155
    m_Localized: Mister Persistence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881156
    m_Localized: 'When played: casts all charms you played this match'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881157
    m_Localized: Informer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881158
    m_Localized: 'On death: summons the weakest creature from your deck'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881159
    m_Localized: Light Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881160
    m_Localized: Destroy a random enemy creature on the battlefield, in hand, and
      in the deck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881161
    m_Localized: Extra Opportunity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881162
    m_Localized: Look at 3 spells, choose 1 and cast it, then shuffle 3 copies of
      it into your deck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881163
    m_Localized: Working Miracles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881164
    m_Localized: 'At the start of turn: cast a random spell'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881165
    m_Localized: Union Banner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881166
    m_Localized: Your creatures gain *+1* speed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881167
    m_Localized: Evil Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881168
    m_Localized: 'At the start of turn: deals *1* damage to a random enemy creature'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881169
    m_Localized: Shady Bookkeeping
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881170
    m_Localized: 'At the start of turn: destroys a random card from the opponent''s
      deck'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881171
    m_Localized: High-Interest Loan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881172
    m_Localized: 'At the start of turn: gain *2* gold'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881173
    m_Localized: Hex
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881174
    m_Localized: 'At the start of turn: the opponent discards a random card'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881175
    m_Localized: Duplicator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5985624568881176
    m_Localized: 'At the start of turn: shuffles a copy of a random card from your
      hand into your deck'
