  - m_Id: 8718668325183498
    m_Localized: "Looking for a free seat\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183499
    m_Localized: "Knocking on the server\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183500
    m_Localized: "Waking up the admin\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183501
    m_Localized: "Elbowing through the queue\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183502
    m_Localized: "Dusting off the database\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183503
    m_Localized: "Recounting your riches\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183504
    m_Localized: "Checking your progress hasn't run off\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183505
    m_Localized: "Digging your account out of the pile\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183506
    m_Localized: "Talking the server into letting you in\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183507
    m_Localized: "Putting the cards back in order\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183508
    m_Localized: "Looking for somewhere to plug the server in\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8718668325183509
    m_Localized: "Negotiating with the cloud\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275818459136
    m_Localized: "This is your commander. Always on hand \u2014 deploy whenever you
      feel like it. Get him killed and he's back next turn, sulking."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207872
    m_Localized: "Gold. It's what puts creatures on the board. Each turn you get
      more and it refills \u2014 hoarding is pointless, spending is a joy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207873
    m_Localized: "Drag a creature from your hand onto your front line. You can afford
      it \u2014 don't be shy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207874
    m_Localized: "A creature has three numbers. Attack \u2014 how hard it hits. Health
      \u2014 how much it takes. Speed \u2014 pay attention to this one."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207875
    m_Localized: Speed means actions, not running. A step costs speed, so does a
      hit. One attack per turn. It all refills at the start of your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207876
    m_Localized: 'Click your creature, then an adjacent cell. A step costs speed:
      out of it? End your turn and it refills.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207877
    m_Localized: 'Reach an enemy creature and hit it: click yours, then the enemy
      next to it. Out of speed? End your turn and continue next one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207878
    m_Localized: "Mana dripped off the corpse. It pays for spells and charms. It
      doesn't appear on its own \u2014 you harvest it from enemy creatures, or by
      other tricks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207879
    m_Localized: "You've got mana \u2014 cast a spell. Spells have requirements:
      no valid target, no cast."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207880
    m_Localized: "There are also charms \u2014 permanent things, also paid in mana.
      You can't hold more than five at once."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207881
    m_Localized: Finale. Punch through to the enemy avatar and keep hitting. Out
      of speed? End your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8723275856207882
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
